---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Agent Authority & Evidence Audit — BitEvo" description="Current bounded BitEvo audit offer. Legacy reliability-audit copy has been superseded.">
  <section class="legacy-guide">
    <div class="container card">
      <div class="kicker">Updated service reference</div>
      <h1>Agent Authority & Evidence Audit</h1>
      <p>This legacy guide URL previously described an older service formulation. The current offer is an evidence-bounded engineering audit; it does not promise that production agents become safe within a fixed number of hours.</p>
      <div class="offer"><strong>USD 4,900 fixed · 5 working days</strong><br/>1 staging/test workflow · up to 3 tools / APIs / MCP servers · 10–20 agreed failure scenarios · executive report · reproducible evidence pack · prioritized repair backlog · one retest.</div>
      <p>Free scope/authority triage and the USD 1,500 reduced-scope entry audit are defined on the canonical pricing page. Hardening is quoted separately after verified findings.</p>
      <p class="boundary">This is an engineering audit, not certification, legal advice, guaranteed security, guaranteed absence of defects, or production penetration testing by default. Written Rules of Engagement are required before testing.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a href="/agent-authority-audit">Canonical audit page</a><a href="/audit-intake">Audit intake</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legacy-guide{padding:64px 0}.card{max-width:820px;background:var(--paper-soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:32px}.kicker{color:var(--gold);font-size:.74rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.card h1{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(2.1rem,5vw,3.2rem);margin:8px 0 16px}.card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.offer,.boundary{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:20px 0}.offer strong{color:var(--gold)}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.actions a{padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:8px;font-weight:900}.actions a:first-child{background:var(--gold);color:#07090a}
</style>
